  \includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{2.jpg}
  \caption{CAR consists of two independent training stages.
Stage 1: Semantic IDs (SIDs) are generated using residual KMeans and combined with Unique ID (UID) to construct the basic modeling unit, the ``act-with-think'' chunk.
Stage 2: On the input side, token representations within each chunk are progressively enhanced via prefix-based embedding augmentation. During training, autoregressive modeling is performed at the chunk level.}
  \label{CAR}
