background and relevant FL security. Section~\ref{problem} outlines the problem formulation followed by the introduction of \textit{SecureFed} framework in Section~\ref{proposed}.  Section~\ref{results} presents the experimental setup, analysis, and results. Finally, Section~\ref{diss} presents the discussions and Section~\ref{conclusion} concludes the paper and presents future research directions.
